  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3002.12 \"Emissions reduction credits (ERCs)\" mean \"ERCs\" as defined in RSA 125-J:1,XIV, namely \"the actual air pollutant reductions from an ERC emission source that have been certified by the department as:\n\n(a) Enforceable;\n\n(b) Permanent;\n\n(c) Quantifiable;\n\n(d) Real; and\n\n(e) Surplus.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
